# Tutors Monorepo Architecture

### Comprehensive Architectural Overview

---

## Overview

The **Tutors Monorepo** unifies the complete Tutors educational platform:

- **Course Generation** — Markdown to structured course data (JSON or static HTML)
- **Course Reading** — Interactive web-based viewer
- **Platform Features** — i18n, accessibility, OAuth, live collaboration
- **Time Analytics** — Student engagement tracking and visualisation

**4 Subsystems**: JSR Packages, Svelte Packages, Applications, Services

---

