## JSR Subsystem

Foundation layer — core data models, course generation, CLI utilities.

Deno-first, Node.js compatible. Published to `jsr.io/@tutors/*`.

![w:900](img/05-jsr-subsystem.png)

---

## JSR — Model Package

**`@tutors/tutors-model-lib`** — Core data structures & types

```typescript
interface Lo {
  type: LoType;     // "course" | "topic" | "lab" | "talk" | etc.
  title: string;
  route: string;
  los?: Lo[];       // Child learning objects
}

interface Course extends Lo {
  type: "course";
  url: string;
  topicIndex: Map<string, Lo>;
}
```

---

## JSR — Gen Package

**`@tutors/tutors-gen-lib`** — Course content generation

- **CourseBuilder** — Scan folders, identify Lo types, build course tree
- **ResourceBuilder** — Parse markdown frontmatter & content
- **TemplateEngine** — Vento-based HTML rendering
- **CourseEmitter** — Write `tutors.json` or static HTML

---

## JSR — Tutors Lite Package

**`@tutors/tutors-lite`** — Static HTML course generation

| Aspect | Tutors | Tutors Lite |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| **Output** | `json/tutors.json` | `html/` static site |
| **Gen function** | `generateDynamicCourse()` | `generateStaticCourse()` |
| **Templates** | None (JSON only) | Vento (`.vto`) |
| **Viewer** | Reader web app | Self-contained, open in browser |

```bash
deno run -A jsr:@tutors/tutors-lite
```

---

## Svelte Package Ecosystem

Six layers from foundation to UI — each building on the layer below.

![h:450](img/06-svelte-ecosystem.png)

---

## Runes Package

**`@tutors/runes`** — Global reactive state using Svelte 5 runes

```typescript
export const currentCourse = {
  get value() {
    return (_currentCourse ??= rune(null)).value;
  },
  set value(v) {
    (_currentCourse ??= rune(null)).value = v;
  }
};
```

Lazy initialization avoids SSR issues.

---

## Course Package

**`@tutors/course`** — Course loading, processing, markdown rendering

- **courseService** — Fetch JSON, cache, decorate tree
- **LiveLab** — Lab step navigation & markdown fetching
- **markdownService** — Shiki highlighting, Mermaid diagrams, Marp rendering

---

## UI Package Trio

**`@tutors/ui-primitives`** — Icon, Image, Menu, Sidebar, LoContextTree, StudentCard

**`@tutors/ui-navigators`** — TutorsShell, MainNavigator, SecondaryNavigator, Footer

**`@tutors/ui-components`** — Learning objects, time views + pre-compiled CSS

![w:900](img/07-ui-components.png)

---

## Applications — SvelteKit Architecture

All apps follow the same structure:

- **Reader** — Main course viewer (`/course`, `/lab`, `/talk`, `/video`, `/note`)
- **Catalogue** — Course discovery & statistics
- **Live** — Real-time student presence tracking
- **Time** — Student engagement analytics (AG Grid, calendar heatmaps, Supabase)

Route groups: `(auth)/`, `(course-reader)/`, `(home)/`

---

## PartyKit Real-Time Service

Room-based WebSocket broadcasting — one room per course.

