## Development Workflow

```bash
# Install & run
pnpm install
cd apps/reader && pnpm dev    # http://localhost:5173

# Anonymous mode (no backend)
echo "PUBLIC_ANON_MODE=TRUE" > apps/reader/.env

# Build UI packages (required before app build)
pnpm --filter @tutors/ui-primitives build
pnpm --filter @tutors/ui-navigators build
pnpm --filter @tutors/ui-components build
pnpm --filter tutors-reader build
```

---

## Deployment

- **JSR Packages** → `deno publish` to jsr.io
- **Reader App** → `pnpm build` → Netlify / Vercel (auto-detected adapter)
- **PartyKit** → `npx partykit deploy`
- **Courses (JSON)** → `deno run -A jsr:@tutors/reader` → deploy `json/` to any static host
- **Courses (HTML)** → `deno run -A jsr:@tutors/tutors-lite` → deploy `html/` to any static host

---

## Contributing

1. Fork → Clone → Branch from `development`
2. Follow commit convention: `Add:`, `Update:`, `Fix:`, `Refactor:`
3. Run `pnpm -r check` for type safety
4. Submit PR to `development`

**Branch Strategy**: `main` (production) ← `development` ← `feature/*` / `fix/*`
